          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Ni no Kuni is a series of role-playing games developed by Level-5. The series chiefly follows the young Oliver, and his journey to another world to save his mother and stop the beckoning evil. The games utilize several magic elements, allowing players to use magical abilities during gameplay, as well as creatures known as imajinn/familiars, which can be tamed for suitability during battle.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Ni no Kuni es una serie de videojuegos de rol desarrollados por Level-5. La serie sigue principalmente al joven Oliver y su viaje a otro mundo para salvar a su madre y detener el mal que lo llama. Los juegos utilizan varios elementos mágicos que permiten a los jugadores usar habilidades mágicas durante la partida, así como criaturas conocidas como imajinn o familiares, que pueden domesticarse para ser útiles en combate.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
